source 2020 Hamburg, Faster Montgomery and double-add ladders for short Weierstrass curves, Figure 3; homogeneous step with explicit denominator tracking, https://www.shiftleft.org/papers/ladder/ladder-tches.pdf
compute YRbar = YP+2*M*XRP
compute E = XQP-XRP
compute F = YRbar*E
compute G = E^2
compute XRPa = XRP*G
compute H = YRbar^2
compute Ma = M*F
compute YPa = YP*F*G
compute K = H+Ma
compute L = K+Ma
compute Mout = XRPa-K
compute XSP = H*L
compute XTP = XRPa^2+YPa
compute YPout = YPa*H
compute Zout = Z*F
